                "The six views that matter most, with two more behind **More measures**. Every figure comes from filed results on Screener, consolidated unless noted. Four companies are shown standalone: **Relaxo** and **Wakefit** have no subsidiaries, **Jyothy** sold its only one in March 2025, and **Campus**'s consolidated page on Screener stops at FY22, so its older figures there are stale. **Wakefit** listed in December 2025, so Screener has fewer quarters for it. **Sheela Foam**'s FY24 cash-flow figures include the Kurlon purchase. Screener counts store leases as borrowings, which makes Metro and Bata look indebted when neither has bank debt. Hover over a starred name for its caveat.",
                "**Where the numbers disagree.** Companies often quote a different ‘EBITDA’ from the filed operating profit. **Campus** includes other income (15.9% in Q1 FY27 against Screener's 14%); **Honasa** quotes margins on ‘like-for-like’ revenue that adds back a Flipkart settlement change; **Sheela Foam**'s ‘core EBITDA’ for FY26 was ₹414cr against Screener's ₹395cr; **Wakefit**'s reported EBITDA adds back about ₹80cr a year of store rent, and its ‘operating EBITDA’ after rent was only 7.5% of FY26 revenue; **Mayur**'s ‘25%+’ margin includes treasury and currency income; **Bajaj Consumer** reports Q1 growth of 28.3% on net sales against Screener's 25%, and an EBITDA margin of 24.7% against 24%. The transcripts stored on the dashboard were often wrong or missing (Bajaj Consumer's Q4 copy was empty). **Honasa**'s Q1 copy named its new fragrance brand ‘Ficken’ instead of FIKN and its nutraceutical target ‘Nutrimar’ instead of Fluence Pharma; **Jyothy**'s Q1 copy gave employee cost as 7.4% of revenue instead of 11.4% and a 6% price rise instead of about 3%; **Sheela Foam**'s Q4 copy put Furlenco's FY26 profit at ₹16cr instead of about ₹60cr; **Relaxo**'s swapped the shares of two brands; **Bata**'s put full-price sales at ‘close to 80%’ instead of 90%. Several dashboard quarters also show zero revenue or profit. Every figure in this note was checked against the filings.",
